OL,3,GNEWSAMayor of London announces         
OL,4,Areshuffle of deputies                  
OL,6,FThe mayor of London has changed his    
OL,7,Fteam of deputy mayors in a leadership  
OL,8,Freshuffle at the Greater London        
OL,9,FAuthority (GLA).                       
OL,11,FSadiq Khan announced that Lib Peck, who
OL,12,Fis currently the director of the London
OL,13,FViolence Reduction Unit (VRU), will be 
OL,14,Fappointed as the deputy mayor for      
OL,15,Fpolicing and crime, subject to         
OL,16,Fconfirmation by the London Assembly.   
OL,18,FThe current deputy mayor for policing  
OL,19,Fand crime, Kaya Comer-Schwartz, will   
OL,20,Fbecome skills commissioner, a new role 
OL,21,Ffocused on employment and skills in the
OL,22,Fcapital.                               
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
