OL,3,GNEWSAMayor of London announces         
OL,4,Areshuffle of deputies                  
OL,6,FAnd Mete Coban, deputy mayor for       
OL,7,Fenvironment and energy, will swap roles
OL,8,Fwith Seb Dance, deputy mayor for       
OL,9,Ftransport. The start date for each     
OL,10,Fappointment has yet to be announced.   
